<title>JAPAN: BOJ injects 400 bln yen into money market-traders.</title>
<headline>BOJ injects 400 bln yen into money market-traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Japan (BOJ) injected a net 400 billion yen into the money market on Tuesday, money traders said.</p>
<p>--Tokyo Treasury Desk, +81-3-5473-3748</p>
</text>
